# =============================================================================
# certbot/secrets/.gitignore
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Defense-in-depth. The repo root .gitignore already blocks *.pem / *.key /
# *.env, but we pin those rules here too so this directory is self-contained
# when extracted.
#
# Rule: deny-by-default, allow only explicit *.example templates.
# =============================================================================

# Real credentials — never commit.
cloudflare.ini
route53.env
*.env
*.ini
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore

# Certbot account key / backup artefacts a careless operator might drop here.
accounts/
archive/
live/
renewal/
*.log

# Allow the .example templates (the whole point of this directory is to keep
# them visible so new operators know the schema).
!*.example
!.gitignore
!README.md
